# VCS and IDE
.git
.gitignore
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.vs
**/*.DotSettings*

# Build outputs and caches.
# NOTE: `**/bin` deliberately NOT excluded — SDK 10.0.203 has a regression
# where its default EmbeddedResource glob (**/*.resx) fails to expand when
# the build context omits `bin/` entries (MSB3552). Keeping `bin/` in
# context is harmless: Release publishes write to a separate output folder.
# Re-evaluate this when upgrading to a newer SDK patch.
**/obj
**/TestResults

# Tests — not needed for production images
**/tests

# Frontend artifacts that should never leak into backend build context
**/node_modules
**/.next

# Local env and secrets — never bake into image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs (trim context size). Service .csproj may declare <None Include="*.md">
# for IDE display, but those items are not used by `dotnet publish`, so
# excluding .md from the build context is safe.
**/*.md
**/CHANGELOG*
**/LICENSE*

# IDE/misc
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.swp
